            `no cash remuneration is paid` IS `no cash remuneration is paid to me`
            `the employee is the child of the employer` IS `I am the child of my employer`
            `the employee is maintained by the employer` IS `I am maintained by my employer`
            `the employment is as a member of the Canadian Forces or the Royal Canadian Mounted Police` IS `I am employed as a member of the Canadian Forces or the Royal Canadian Mounted Police`
            `another Act of Parliament provides otherwise for that employment` IS `another Act of Parliament provides otherwise for my employment`
            `the employer employs persons in Canada` IS `my employer employs persons in Canada`
            `a reciprocal agreement between the Government of Canada and the government of another country exempts the employer from liability to make the contributions imposed on an employer by this Act` IS `a reciprocal agreement exempts my employer from the contributions imposed on an employer by this Act`
            `the employment is by Her Majesty in right of a province or by an agent of Her Majesty in right of a province` IS `my employment is by Her Majesty in right of a province or by an agent of Her Majesty in right of a province`
