      `I have made an election to exclude my self-employed earnings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you made an election under paragraph 13(1)(b) to exclude your self-employed earnings?
      `the month referred to in my election to exclude my self-employed earnings` IS A DATE @desc If so, what month does it refer to? (Any date in that month.)
      `I have revoked my election to exclude my self-employed earnings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you revoked that election to exclude self-employed earnings?
      `the month referred to in my revocation` IS A DATE @desc If so, what month does the revocation refer to? (Any date in that month.)
      `the Year's Additional Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the Year's Additional Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year, in dollars? (Section 18.1.)
      `leave out the effect of my elections (paragraphs (b) and (c))` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you want the figure with the effect of your elections (paragraphs (b) and (c)) left out, as subsections 8(6), (7), (10) and (11) ask for?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What are my additional maximum pensionable earnings for the year` IS
    IF `leave out the effect of my elections (paragraphs (b) and (c))`
    THEN `s 17.1 — the additional maximum pensionable earnings of a person for a year, determined without taking into account paragraphs (b) and (c)` `my facts` `the Year's Additional Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year`
    ELSE `s 17.1 — the additional maximum pensionable earnings of a person for a year` `my facts` `the Year's Additional Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year`
    WHERE
        `my facts` MEANS `cp1 Facts about a person for a year` WITH
            `the year at hand` IS `the year I am asking about`
            `date of birth of the person` IS `my date of birth`
            `date of death of the person` IS (IF `the person has died` THEN JUST `the date of death` ELSE NOTHING)
            `date the contributory period of the person ends by reason of disability` IS (IF `my contributory period ended by reason of disability in the year` THEN JUST `the date my contributory period ended by reason of disability` ELSE NOTHING)
            `date the disability pension ceases to be payable to the person` IS (IF `my disability pension stopped being payable in the year` THEN JUST `the date my disability pension stopped being payable` ELSE NOTHING)
            `months excluded from the contributory period of the person by reason of disability` IS
                IF `some months are excluded from my contributory period by reason of disability` THEN LIST `my run of excluded months` ELSE EMPTY
            `month from which a retirement pension is payable to the person` IS (IF `a retirement pension is payable to me` THEN JUST `the first month for which my retirement pension is payable` ELSE NOTHING)
            `date the person makes an election under subparagraph 12(1)(c)(ii)` IS (IF `I have made an election to exclude my income after I reach sixty-five` THEN JUST `the date I made that election` ELSE NOTHING)
            `date the person revokes the election under subparagraph 12(1)(c)(ii)` IS (IF `I have revoked that election` THEN JUST `the date I revoked that election` ELSE NOTHING)
            `month referred to in the election of the person under paragraph 13(1)(b)` IS (IF `I have made an election to exclude my self-employed earnings` THEN JUST `the month referred to in my election to exclude my self-employed earnings` ELSE NOTHING)
            `month referred to in the revocation by the person under paragraph 13(1)(c)` IS (IF `I have revoked my election to exclude my self-employed earnings` THEN JUST `the month referred to in my revocation` ELSE NOTHING)
        `my run of excluded months` MEANS `cp1 Month period` WITH
            `first month of the month period` IS `the first month excluded by reason of disability`
            `last month of the month period` IS (IF `the months excluded by reason of disability have ended` THEN JUST `the last month excluded by reason of disability` ELSE NOTHING)

-- s 19. The Year's Basic Exemption, prorated as in section 17; and, in a year in which a retirement pension becomes payable to you, prorated by the months before it becomes payable
-- and increased where your earnings exceed the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings adjusted by that proportion (paragraph (d)).
@export What is my basic exemption for the year, in dollars (s 19)?
GIVEN `the year I am asking about` IS A NUMBER @desc Which calendar year are you asking about?
      `my date of birth` IS A DATE @desc What is your date of birth?
      `the person has died` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the person you are asking about died? (Answer yes if you are the executor or administrator of someone who has died.)
      `the date of death` IS A DATE @desc If the person has died, on what date? (Any date if not.)
      `my contributory period ended by reason of disability in the year` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did your contributory period under the Plan, or under a provincial pension plan, end by reason of disability during the year?
      `the date my contributory period ended by reason of disability` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what date? (Any date if not.)
      `my disability pension stopped being payable in the year` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did a disability pension payable to you under the Plan, or under a provincial pension plan, stop being payable during the year?
      `the date my disability pension stopped being payable` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what date? (Any date if not.)
      `some months are excluded from my contributory period by reason of disability` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are any months excluded from your contributory period by reason of disability?
      `the first month excluded by reason of disability` IS A DATE @desc If so, what is the first month excluded? (Any date in that month.)
      `the months excluded by reason of disability have ended` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that run of excluded months ended?
      `the last month excluded by reason of disability` IS A DATE @desc If it has ended, what is the last month excluded? (Any date in that month.)
      `a retirement pension is payable to me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a retirement pension payable to you under the Plan or under a provincial pension plan?
      `the first month for which my retirement pension is payable` IS A DATE @desc If so, what is the first month for which it is payable? (Any date in that month.)
      `I have made an election to exclude my income after I reach sixty-five` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you made an election under subparagraph 12(1)(c)(ii) to exclude your income after you reach sixty-five years of age?
      `the date I made that election` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what date did you make it? (Any date if not.)
      `I have revoked that election` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you revoked that election?
      `the date I revoked that election` IS A DATE @desc If so, on what date? (Any date if not.)
      `I have made an election to exclude my self-employed earnings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you made an election under paragraph 13(1)(b) to exclude your self-employed earnings?
      `the month referred to in my election to exclude my self-employed earnings` IS A DATE @desc If so, what month does it refer to? (Any date in that month.)
      `I have revoked my election to exclude my self-employed earnings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you revoked that election to exclude self-employed earnings?
      `the month referred to in my revocation` IS A DATE @desc If so, what month does the revocation refer to? (Any date in that month.)
      `the Year's Basic Exemption for the year` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the Year's Basic Exemption for the year, in dollars? (Section 20.)
      `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year, in dollars? (Section 18; the question above works it out.)
      `the aggregate of my contributory salary and wages and my contributory self-employed earnings for the year` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate of your contributory salary and wages and your contributory self-employed earnings for the year, in dollars?
      `leave out the effect of my elections (paragraphs (b) and (c))` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you want the figure with the effect of your elections (paragraphs (b) and (c)) left out, as subsections 8(6), (7), (10) and (11) ask for?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What is my basic exemption for the year` IS
    IF `leave out the effect of my elections (paragraphs (b) and (c))`
    THEN `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year, determined without taking into account paragraphs (b) and (c)` `my facts` `the Year's Basic Exemption for the year` `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year` `the aggregate of my contributory salary and wages and my contributory self-employed earnings for the year`
    ELSE `s 19 — the basic exemption of a person for a year` `my facts` `the Year's Basic Exemption for the year` `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year` `the aggregate of my contributory salary and wages and my contributory self-employed earnings for the year`
    WHERE
        `my facts` MEANS `cp1 Facts about a person for a year` WITH
            `the year at hand` IS `the year I am asking about`
            `date of birth of the person` IS `my date of birth`
            `date of death of the person` IS (IF `the person has died` THEN JUST `the date of death` ELSE NOTHING)
            `date the contributory period of the person ends by reason of disability` IS (IF `my contributory period ended by reason of disability in the year` THEN JUST `the date my contributory period ended by reason of disability` ELSE NOTHING)
            `date the disability pension ceases to be payable to the person` IS (IF `my disability pension stopped being payable in the year` THEN JUST `the date my disability pension stopped being payable` ELSE NOTHING)
